/! The calculation, fetched into the detail frame the shell left empty. Also
/! the response to a slider change, so the frame is the only thing that gets
/! recomputed and replaced.
/! Only the frame's contents are replaced, so its layout classes stay with the
/! placeholder in _show.html.slim.
= turbo_frame_tag 'amortization_detail' do
  = render 'detail'
